Package: hvtiRtables
Title: Manuscript-Compliant Table Construction for HVTI CORR Group
Version: 1.0.9
Authors@R:
    person("John", "Ehrlinger", , "ehrlinj@ccf.org", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Turns 'gtsummary' table objects into 'MS Word' tables that
    follow the "Table Construction for Manuscripts" rules of the HVTI
    (Heart, Vascular and Thoracic Institute) CORR (Cardiovascular Outcomes,
    Registries and Research) group: footnotes and abbreviation keys as text
    below the table, no hidden spacer columns, and the house notation and
    rounding. Tables are drawn in a style named by its role: a report style,
    with flat headers, and a manuscript style, which lays a table out to
    compare groups or to describe cohorts side by side.
License: GPL-3
